title: "Tahoe-100M drug perturbation analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the Tahoe-100M single-cell drug perturbation study:
  per (cell line, drug, dose) phenotypic metrics, similarity network fusion
  clustering over those metrics, and pseudobulk signature reproducibility.
